        """Gets the variables the leader is drawn with, as AutoCAD's GetDimstyleData: a new DxfDimStyleTableRecord
        in no table, named as its DxfLeader.DimensionStyleName, each of its 74 variables as the leader reads it,
        its override (the list DSTYLE of its extended data of ACAD) where it has one, else its style's, else
        AutoCAD's own. A leader of the style ISO-25 given an arrow 3.5 long gives Dimasz 3.5 and Dimtxt 2.5, the
        style's."""
