        else from its angle (50, in degrees), else from the direction it reads along where it has neither, as
        DxfMText.Direction says: pi on the normal (0, 0, -1), as AutoCAD 2021 reads it. An annotative MTEXT's is
        that of the direction of the context it is read at (its 10, 20, 30), as DxfMText.Location says."""
