        and an ARC for each bulged one, in its order, as DxfReader draws it (one fitted to a curve or a spline
        through the vertices it is drawn through), each with its look and thickness; its widths left out, as
        AutoCAD leaves them out, and a segment of no length too. Each LINE and ARC is on the polyline's
