        whose knots are not clamped clamped by knot insertion, and one of fit points alone the cubic AutoCAD 2021
        fits through them. The cubic with the control points (0, 0, 0), (100, 150, 0), (200, 150, 0) and (300, 0,
        0) is the GeoSpline3 of those points and the knots 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1."""
