        30) and (10, 25) is at 0 its vertices at 0, 40.71, 55.57 (two fifths of the range), 71.70 and 111.15; the
        straight cubic of 4 points is 1 segment at 0 and 1, 3 at 2 and 3; the quintic Bezier over 0 to 50 is cut
        in thirds at 0."""
