        D32 run); fit points of the curve at its knots, which AutoCAD fits anew when it reads them, would not
        give the curve back."""
    def WeightAt(self, index: int) -> float:
        """Gets the weight of a control point, as AutoCAD's WeightAt: 1 for every point of a spline that is not
