        given a content is no longer one emptied in the session (D33e g12, g14). The numbers are those of a whole
        number or a number value, or before R2007 a text that reads as one. A series of dates goes on as AutoCAD
        2021's console took them (D42), in seconds counted as the C library's mktime counts them, the date as
