        the last date by the step between the last two (a day for one date), or in reverse back from the first by
        the step between the first two, so that 1/1/2020 filled into three cells is 1/1/2020 17:00, 1/2/2020
        17:00 and 1/3/2020 17:00 in a zone seven hours ahead of Greenwich and 1/2/2020, 1/3/2020 and 1/4/2020 in
