        page lacks written as its escape within its piece and an escape given counted as its one letter, so that
        300 D with stroke, given as letters or as escapes, are a 3 of 250 escapes and a 1 of 50 (AutoCAD reads a
        cell in groups 2 as empty, and the escapes of each piece alone); from R2007 on its value written as a
        text (90 of 4), in pieces of 2 and a last 1, and its text in pieces of 303 and a last 302, the value's
        flags (93) made 6 where they had the flag 1 of no value, which AutoCAD 2021 reads as none whatever the
        text (a block cell made a text cell and given M16 read empty), and the cell given the flag of its kind of
        value (91 262144) where it has it not, as AutoCAD 2021 gave a cell reset (D33e w10). An empty text is,
        from R2007 on, the value of none DxfTable.ResetValue leaves, as AutoCAD 2021 wrote it (93 7, 90 0, the
        flag 0x40000 taken out, D33c r09, D33d s01 to s10), the looks of the content gone with it as there,
        whatever the cell held: B-12, 1.5 or the empty text of the title's hidden cell given an empty text are of
        no value. A pointer to a field (344) is taken out, the text being the cell's own now, and the field
        erased with its children where the table owns it and nothing else of the file points at it, a copy of the
        table among them. The words the cell has, as they are written or as they read, change nothing. The block
        AutoCAD drew the table with is not drawn anew."""
