        """Gets the text of a cell, as AutoCAD's TextString: from R2007 on the text of its value, its pieces (303)
        and its last (302) one after another, before R2007 its groups 3 or 2 and 1, each escape of four digits
        read as the letter it stands for, as AutoCAD 2021 reads it, B\\U+0110 giving BĐ, and each multibyte code
        of a letter of two bytes (\\M+) that letter; empty for a cell of no text, as a block cell."""
    def TextStringConst(self, row: int, col: int) -> str:
