        for a third in fractions, 1'-0 1/2\" for 12.5 in feet and inches and 1, 5, 0 for a point; the format's
        unit is its %lu (6, the drawing's, follows LUNITS) and a cell of none is in decimals. The thousands,
        prefix and suffix of a format are left out. A date is the date alone where it has no time, the time alone
