        before R2007, gives its DxfTable.TextString."""
    def TextStyle(self, row: int, col: int) -> DxfTextStyleTableRecord:
        """Gets the text style of a cell's text, as AutoCAD's TextStyle gives its id: the cell's own (7, by name);
